# Purpose: Normalize repository text files for cross-platform JIMPITAN development and VPS deployment.
# Caller: Git checkout, commit, and archive operations.
# Deps: Git attributes support.
# MainFuncs: Keeps source/config/docs as text and preserves LF for shell scripts, Dockerfiles, YAML, and generated deployment configs.
# SideEffects: Controls line-ending normalization in Git worktrees.

* text=auto

*.sh text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.mts text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.prisma text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.Dockerfile text eol=lf
